---
import { REPO_URL } from '../lib/site';
---

<section id="privacy">
  <h2>Architecture &amp; privacy</h2>
  <p class="section-intro">
    Entirely local. No user data is collected, uploaded, or tracked.
  </p>

  <ul class="safety-grid">
    <li>
      <div class="safety-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M11 2.8 4.8 11h5l-.8 6.2 6.2-8.2h-5l.8-6.2Z"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <strong>Built on Rust and Rune</strong>
      <span>
        The app uses <a href="https://github.com/anomalyco/rune">Rune</a> from Anomaly (a
        Metal-backed Rust UI) instead of Electron or a webview, keeping response times fast and
        binary size and memory use low.
      </span>
    </li>

    <li>
      <div class="safety-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <ellipse cx="10" cy="5.2" rx="6" ry="2.4"></ellipse>
          <path d="M4 5.2v9.6c0 1.3 2.7 2.4 6 2.4s6-1.1 6-2.4V5.2M4 10c0 1.3 2.7 2.4 6 2.4s6-1.1 6-2.4"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <strong>100% local SQLite</strong>
      <span>
        Projects, updates, screenshots, and notebook pages live in{' '}
        <code>~/Library/Application Support/feeder</code>. No accounts, no cloud sync, and no data
        collected or sent anywhere.
      </span>
    </li>

    <li>
      <div class="safety-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M4 14.5h12M6.5 14.5V7a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 7 0v7.5"></path>
          <circle cx="10" cy="10.2" r="1.2"></circle>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <strong>No open network ports</strong>
      <span>
        Agents launch <code>feeder mcp</code> as a local child process over stdin and stdout. The
        only outbound request is an hourly check against GitHub Releases for app updates.
      </span>
    </li>

    <li>
      <div class="safety-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M10 2.6 16 5v4.7c0 3.7-2.5 6.8-6 7.8-3.5-1-6-4.1-6-7.8V5l6-2.4Z"></path>
          <path d="m7.5 10.2 1.7 1.7 3.4-3.6"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <strong>Signed, notarized, verified</strong>
      <span>
        Releases are signed with an Apple Developer ID, built with the hardened runtime, and
        notarized by Apple. Updates are verified against Feeder's EdDSA key and only install when
        you click.
      </span>
    </li>

    <li>
      <div class="safety-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M6 3.5h5.5L15 7v9.5a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H6a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-12a1 1 0 0 1 1-1Z"></path>
          <path d="M11.5 3.5V7H15M8 11.5h4M8 14h2.8"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <strong>Reversible config changes</strong>
      <span>
        Feeder only edits an agent tool's settings when you click Connect or Disconnect, and writes
        a <code>.feeder-backup</code> copy before changing anything.
      </span>
    </li>

    <li>
      <div class="safety-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="m7 6.5-3.5 3.5L7 13.5M13 6.5l3.5 3.5-3.5 3.5M11.2 4.5l-2.4 11"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <strong>MIT open source</strong>
      <span>
        The Rust workspace, Swift menu bar helper, and site source are public on{' '}
        <a href={REPO_URL}>GitHub</a>. See{' '}
        <a href={`${REPO_URL}/blob/main/SECURITY.md`}>SECURITY.md</a> to report a vulnerability.
      </span>
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>

<style>
  .safety-grid {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .safety-grid li {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 22px;
    box-shadow: var(--card-shadow);
  }
  .safety-icon {
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .safety-icon svg {
    width: 17px;
    height: 17px;
    display: block;
  }
  .safety-grid strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 15.5px;
    font-weight: 620;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }
  .safety-grid span {
    display: block;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .safety-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .safety-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
